  "title": "Neighbourhood delivery · Level 2: Bakery, then house 7",
  "brief": "Drive 5 squares to the bakery, wait there with the light on until the 2 s parcel load ends, then 2 squares more to house 7 and flash the light. The delivery counts only after the bakery stop (light on at least 1.9 s); that stop is not a delivery to house 5. 60 s. 50 for the delivery, and then up to 40 for speed (the run's time against par 14 s); 10 for no wheel on the grass, paid on its own; a delivery to another house scores 0, and a light at house 5 shorter than 1.9 s is a delivery to house 5. The level runs at the Junior speed, 200 mm/s and 90 deg/s (Junior mode's hidden set-up sets it; a Python program sets it with drive_base.settings(straight_speed=200, turn_rate=90)).",
